      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Orelha-de-Pau. Toedscool vive em florestas úmidas. As partes que caem de seu corpo são mastigáveis e deliciosas. Apesar da semelhança com Tentacool, pertence a outra espécie. Suas pernas finas permitem correr a quase 48 km/h.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/4 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Grama &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Toedscool pode evoluir para Toedscruel a partir do nível 10. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Mud-Slap, Wrap</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Absorb</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Poison Powder, Stun Spore</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Supersonic</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Tackle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Mega Drain</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Screech</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Mud Shot</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Hex</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Seed Bomb</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Spore</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Growth</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Earth Power, Giga Drain</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>16</td><td>Power Whip</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Acid Spray, Bullet Seed, Confuse Ray, Dazzling Gleam, Earth Power, Endure, Energy Ball, Flash Cannon, Foul Play, Giga Drain, Grass Knot, Grassy Glide, Grassy Terrain, Hex, Knock Off, Leaf Storm, Light Screen, Lunge, Magical Leaf, Mud Shot, Mud-Slap, Pain Split, Protect, Rain Dance, Reflect, Rest, Scary Face, Seed Bomb, Sleep Talk, Sludge Bomb, Solar Beam, Spikes, Substitute, Swift, Taunt, Tera Blast, Toxic, Toxic Spikes, Trailblaze, Trick Room, Venoshock</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Acupressure, Knock Off, Leech Seed, Mirror Coat, Rage Powder, Rapid Spin, Tickle, Toxic</p>",
